Libraries served to published artifacts

backend/app/core/catalog/artifact_lib/ holds the libraries the deployment serves
to the pages and drawings its agents make, copied byte for byte from their npm
packages:

  Chart.js 4.5.1   https://www.chartjs.org      MIT
                   Copyright (c) 2014-2024 Chart.js Contributors
  d3 7.9.0         https://d3js.org             ISC
                   Copyright 2010-2023 Mike Bostock
  Lucide 1.46.0    https://lucide.dev           ISC, and MIT for the icons
                   derived from Feather
                   Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors
                   Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole Bemis
  three.js 0.186.0 https://threejs.org         MIT
                   Copyright (c) 2010-2026 three.js authors
  Mermaid 12.1.0   https://mermaid.js.org      MIT, with bundled dependencies
                   under their own licences (see the README), among them
                   elkjs under EPL-2.0 and DOMPurify under Apache-2.0
                   Copyright (c) 2014 - 2022 Knut Sveidqvist
  idiomorph 0.8.0  https://github.com/bigskysoftware/idiomorph   0BSD
  Leaflet 1.9.4    https://leafletjs.com        BSD-2-Clause
                   Copyright (c) 2010-2023, Volodymyr Agafonkin
                   Copyright (c) 2010-2011, CloudMade

Copied rather than installed because a published page has no network and loads
them from the deployment itself. The README beside them carries every licence
text in full.

The map kit beside them (agenticos-map-1.js and agenticos-map-2.js) adapts the
pin-drop timing of createTripAnimator, and the visual-design skill borrows guidance, from Open
Intelligent UI (https://github.com/CopilotKit/OpenIntelligentUI), MIT,
Copyright (c) Atai Barkai. The notice is kept in each file's header.

